{'symbol': 'K', 'date': '2022-12-06 09:13:00', 'title': 'KELLOGG DONATES 30 MILLION SERVINGS OF FOOD TO FEEDING AMERICA', 'text': 'CONTRIBUTION MADE TO SUPPORT FOOD INSECURE FAMILIES DURING THE HOLIDAYS BATTLE CREEK, MICH. , DEC. 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KELLOGG COMPANY ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS DONATED 30 MILLION SERVINGS OF FOOD TO FEEDING AMERICA FOOD BANKS ACROSS THE U.S. THE DONATION INCLUDES CEREAL, SNACKS SUCH AS BARS AND CRACKERS, AND EGGO PRODUCTS.'}